  'pretoria-teen-veldsman-wins-two-medals-youth-olympics-2026-11-03',
  'Pretoria teen wins two swimming medals at Youth Olympics',
  'Sport', '2026-11-03', 'SuperSport Schools News', 'https://superschoolsnews.co.za/second-medal-for-veldsman-at-youth-olympics/',
  'Die Hoerskool Menlopark pupil Chanel Veldsman won bronze and silver in the breaststroke events at the Dakar Youth Olympic Games this week.',
  'A Pretoria schoolgirl has emerged as one of the brightest spots for Team South Africa at this year''s Youth Olympic Games, being held in Dakar, Senegal. Chanel Veldsman, a learner at Die Hoerskool Menlopark who trains with TuksSport, won bronze in the women''s 200m breaststroke on Monday, 2 November, clocking a personal-best time of 2:30.87. She followed it up the next day with silver in the 100m breaststroke, finishing in 1:09.48 behind Japan''s Mana Ishikawa, who took gold in 1:08.81.

The two medals made Veldsman the first South African swimmer at these Games to reach the podium twice. Her silver was the team''s third silver and fifth medal overall in Dakar, a tally that equalled what South Africa brought home from the 2018 Buenos Aires Youth Olympics. She said winning two medals in two days felt "amazing", after a period in which she had moved away from home and changed schools to focus on her swimming.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://superschoolsnews.co.za/second-medal-for-veldsman-at-youth-olympics/", "https://www.ewn.co.za/2026/11/05/south-africa-hits-five-medal-mark-at-dakar-youth-olympic-games", "https://townpress.co.za/team-sas-sevens-silver-came-down-to-a-one-minute-chase/"]',
  'agent'
);
